Welcome, traveler. These hills remember every life you have lived.
+ [Tell me about Alby.]
    Three trials hold the northern gate: a wandering spider, a trapped chest, and a stone switch. Clear them to face the Giant Spider.
    + [And the treasure?]
        Beyond the guardian lie five chests. Choose one. What you claim is yours, even if your next expedition ends badly.
        -> END
    + [I am ready.]
        Then keep a potion close, and let no haste outrun your judgment.
        -> END
+ [How does rebirth work?]
    A new life restores your youth and lets you choose another talent. Your skills, AP, possessions, and lifetime progress endure.
    -> END
+ [Thank you.]
    May the road lead you safely home.
    -> END
